	"name": "Sacrificial Destruction",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/death/skull-fire-white-yellow.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 7th level, a sentinel can target their undead companion and detonate them as a reaction to the companion reaching 0 HP. Each creature within a 10ft radius of the companion must make a Constitution saving throw or take 3d6 thunder damage and become poisoned for 1 minute, taking half damage and not being poisoned on a successful save. While poisoned, a creature may make an additional Constitution saving throw at the end of each of their turns to end the poisoned condition.</p>",
